  data: {
    LLM: "Conserve your Tens and Aces for 'Multi-Leads'. If you lead two 10s at once, the opponent must produce two cards to beat them, which is statistically difficult.\n\nStock Management: Always keep a Trump card in your hand to defend against a 'Bura' declaration. If you are 'void' of trumps, you are a vulnerable target for multi-card leads.\n\nThe 'Goat' Trap: If you see an opponent has no tricks by the halfway point, lead low non-scoring cards to prevent them from winning anything. If they end with zero tricks, they take double penalty points (The Full Goat).",
    Player: "Conserve your Tens and Aces for 'Multi-Leads'. If you lead two 10s at once, the opponent must produce two cards to beat them, which is statistically difficult.\n\nStock Management: Always keep a Trump card in your hand to defend against a 'Bura' declaration. If you are 'void' of trumps, you are a vulnerable target for multi-card leads.\n\nThe 'Goat' Trap: If you see an opponent has no tricks by the halfway point, lead low non-scoring cards to prevent them from winning anything. If they end with zero tricks, they take double penalty points (The Full Goat).",
